Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:47:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 141/143] config: F2FS (+compression), CFS bandwidth for
 home-server use (v0.4.1)

Enable the options a small self-hosted box wants that were still missing;
USER_NS, SECCOMP_FILTER, CGROUP_PIDS, BLK_CGROUP and ZRAM were already on.

  - F2FS_FS=m (+XATTR +POSIX_ACL +COMPRESSION with LZ4/ZSTD/LZO) for a data
    partition. Module, not builtin: it is not the rootfs, so it loads on mount.
    Transparent compression saves space and cuts writes to SD/eMMC/NVMe.
  - CFS_BANDWIDTH=y so systemd CPUQuota= can share the CPU across services
    (CGROUP_SCHED / FAIR_GROUP_SCHED were already enabled).

Together with CGROUP_PIDS (TasksMax=), BLK_CGROUP (IOWeight=) and seccomp
already present, this lets a home server cap forks, CPU and I/O per service
and confine them.

Co-Authored-By: AI Agent
---
 arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
index c8583dc62..cad6e1b90 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/opi4a_blindboot_defconfig
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ CONFIG_IKCONFIG_PROC=y
 CONFIG_NUMA_BALANCING=y
 CONFIG_MEMCG=y
 CONFIG_BLK_CGROUP=y
+CONFIG_CFS_BANDWIDTH=y
 CONFIG_CGROUP_PIDS=y
 CONFIG_CGROUP_FREEZER=y
 CONFIG_CGROUP_HUGETLB=y
@@ -1014,6 +1015,8 @@ CONFIG_EXT4_FS_POSIX_ACL=y
 CONFIG_EXT4_FS_SECURITY=y
 CONFIG_BTRFS_FS=m
 CONFIG_BTRFS_FS_POSIX_ACL=y
+CONFIG_F2FS_FS=m
+CONFIG_F2FS_FS_COMPRESSION=y
 CONFIG_FANOTIFY=y
 CONFIG_FANOTIFY_ACCESS_PERMISSIONS=y
 CONFIG_QUOTA=y
